  "contentHtml": "<P>귀국한지 이제 2년 6개월이 넘어간다.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">영어공부를&nbsp;어떻게 꾸준히 할까?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">이번 방학에 규리(6학년)와 영어공부를 시작했다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">딸에게 영어를 가르친다는 명분으로 시작했지만</SPAN></P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">사실은 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">나도 영어공부를 하고 싶었기 때문이다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">교재는</SPAN></P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">CNN student (</SPAN><A href=\"http://edition.cnn.com/studentnews/\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">http://edition.cnn.com/studentnews/</SPAN></A><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">매일 올라오는 기사에서</SPAN></P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1. Daily Curriculum</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">의 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">Fast Fact </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">중에서 규리가 하나를 고른다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; (8월에 올라온 기사에는 Daily Curriculum은 없습니다. CNN에 문의했는데 아직 답장은 못 받았습니다.)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">2. 질문들을 소리내어 읽고 해석한다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">3. 방송을 보며 답을 생각한다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">4. 질문을 보며 답을 영어로 말한다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">답을 말하지 못한 부분을 다시 한 번 시청한다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">5. Discussion Question&nbsp;혹은 방송내용 관련된 질문을&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">영어로 말한다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">6. 해당 방송의 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">Transcript</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">를 영어로 읽고 해석한다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">7. 모르는 단어를 찾아 영영 풀이와 예문을 단어장에 정리한다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">이 공부법의 장점은</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">1. 서로 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif\">질문이나 답변을 영어로 하면서 영어 커뮤니케이션 능력을 키울 수 있다.</SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2. 아빠도 시간내서 영어 공부를 할 수 있다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3. 공부를 하면서 딸과&nbsp;이야기를 많이 나눌 수 있다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4. 사교육비가 절감된다!</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">개학해서도 꾸준히 하려구요^^</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">재미있네요!</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
